	"heading": "Transport Layer Security (TLS)",
	"headingTranslation": {
		"text": "トランスポート層セキュリティ (TLS)",
		"sourceHash": "9507d4ac72d66333e672b706dec4d4c278150753852ba3bb607554dc9bfb64f9"
	},
	"definitions": [
		{
			"location": {
				"url": "https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b.html#def-and-acr"
			},
			"source": [
				{
					"type": "paragraph",
					"children": [
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": "An authentication and security protocol that is widely implemented in browsers and web servers. TLS provides confidentiality, certificate-based authentication of the receiving (server) endpoint, and certificate-based authentication of the originating (client) endpoint. TLS is specified in "
						},
						{
							"type": "link",
							"href": "https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b/references/#ref-RFC8446",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "[RFC8446]"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": " and "
						},
						{
							"type": "link",
							"href": "https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b/references/#ref-SP800-52",
							"children": [
								{
									"type": "text",
									"value": "[SP800-52]"
								}
							]
						},
						{
							"type": "text",
							"value": "."
						}
					]
				}
			],
			"translation": {
				"content": [
					{
						"type": "paragraph",
						"children": [
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": "ブラウザーとウェブサーバーで広く実装されている、認証とセキュリティのためのプロトコル。TLS は、機密性と、受信側 (サーバー) のエンドポイントの証明書による認証と、発信側 (クライアント) のエンドポイントの証明書による認証を提供する。TLS は "
							},
							{
								"type": "link",
								"href": "https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b/references/#ref-RFC8446",
								"children": [
									{
										"type": "text",
										"value": "[RFC8446]"
									}
								]
							},
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": " と "
							},
							{
								"type": "link",
								"href": "https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b/references/#ref-SP800-52",
								"children": [
									{
										"type": "text",
										"value": "[SP800-52]"
									}
								]
							},
							{
								"type": "text",
								"value": " で規定されている。"
							}
						]
					}
				],
				"sourceHash": "f007ba855fe7bb362abe5de5388e1b706e43bf656b210ecf3d8a202d68eee277"
			}
		}
	],
